  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_6d1ee7ae-0ec9-48af-97fb-5ceccb90ef57.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"323\" height=\"323\"><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminestrator.com%252fa%252fCREATEFRANCE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_00b06b57-5783-4c54-a00c-c012ec97c019.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SykPYgYkKk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/647559221855911938?style=flat-square&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Discord&amp;labelColor=#1fcf5a&amp;color=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"161\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.20.1-Create_France?style=flat-square&amp;logo=CURSEFORGE&amp;label=Create France&amp;labelColor=#1fcf5a&amp;color=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"25\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/在线-服务器?style=flat-square&amp;logo=Minetest&amp;label=服务器&amp;labelColor=#1fcf5a&amp;color=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"25\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>当前版本</strong>: 1.1.1<br>新版本 1.1.2 修复了桥梁结构的FPS错误，并为桥梁添加了说明以帮助理解其工作原理<br><strong>兼容性</strong>: Minecraft 1.20.1 &amp; 1.21.1 Neoforge + 与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 5 和 Create 6</a><br>1.1.2<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_253e8444-3c0c-46f9-9567-20d0b85ee4e4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"521\"><br>1.0.8<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_cf97e8e6-dd06-47dc-bba2-f235a43ce4ca.png\"></p><p>1.0.5</p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_9a9b143e-66a0-4f4a-ac49-55aee81e41ec.png\"></p><p>1.0.4</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_0efb8457-ef0e-4f5e-bca9-3c9d0d44e938.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"303\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_72d5e724-4e88-4ce7-9367-3a6869e740d6.png\" width=\"486\" height=\"308\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_eb7cfdea-6204-4b8b-90d8-d48f169d33e2.png\"></p><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2><h2>关于模组</h2><p>欢迎来到 <strong>Create Furniture（机械动力：家具）</strong>，这是一款通过添加工业风格家具来增强你的Minecraft体验的模组！如果你是 <strong>机械动力（Create）</strong>模组的粉丝，这款模组通过引入各种材质和颜色的桌子、椅子、凳子等家具，完美补充你的建筑。非常适合装饰车间、餐厅或舒适的蒸汽朋克角落！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></p><h2>主要特点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>桌子</strong>：基于机械动力模组的标志性材料，有4种变体：<br><br>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>安山岩外壳</strong></li>\n<li><strong>铜制外壳</strong></li>\n<li><strong>铁路外壳</strong></li>\n<li><strong>黄铜外壳</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>椅子</strong>：每把椅子都与桌子的材质相匹配，营造和谐的外观。你可以坐在上面以获得最大沉浸感！</li>\n<li><strong>凳子</strong>：小巧实用，非常适合舒适的角落或工业车间。</li>\n<li><strong>颜色</strong>：每种家具都有4种不同颜色可选，以实现更多个性化定制。<br><br><br></li>\n<li><strong>柱子</strong>：新增了柱子</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>小型安山岩柱</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>小型黄铜柱</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>高安山岩柱</strong></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></p><hr><h2>截图</h2><p><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_2baae0a8-fe7a-426d-9e02-308d3f103323.png\"></em></p><p><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_129a7a38-69f4-401e-962b-c75f89bbd783.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></em></p><h2>如何合成家具？</h2><p>合成这些家具简单直观！将机械动力外壳放入切石机中即可</p><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2><h2>与机械动力的集成</h2><ul>\n<li>家具使用机械动力模组的材料，确保完美的美学融合。</li>\n<li>兼容机械动力的高级机械，如<strong>装配线</strong>。</li>\n<li>为你的机械系统和工业基地增添装饰性点缀！</li>\n</ul><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2><h2>安装说明</h2><ol>\n<li>确保你已经安装了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力（Create）</a> 模组。</li>\n<li>从此页面下载 <strong>Create Furniture（机械动力：家具）</strong> 文件。</li>\n<li>将 .jar 文件放入你的Minecraft安装目录的 <strong>mods</strong> 文件夹中。</li>\n<li>启动游戏，享受你的新家具吧！</li>\n</ol><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2><h2>兼容性与漏洞</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>兼容性</strong>：适用于所有与 <strong>机械动力</strong> 兼容的版本。</li>\n<li><strong>已知漏洞</strong>：目前没有。如果发现任何问题，请在“问题”部分报告。</li>\n</ul><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2><h2>鸣谢</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>作者</strong>：<em>Arginou</em></li>\n<li><strong>资源与灵感</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力（Create）</a> 模组</li>\n</ul><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2><h2>实用链接</h2><ul>\n<li>我的社区服务器整合包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/serveur-create-france-communauty-friends-coop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create France 服务器</a></li>\n<li>我的Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/ScMHdge2uv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt;&gt;链接&lt;&lt;</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h3>感谢下载 Create Furniture（机械动力：家具）！</h3><p>如果你喜欢这款模组，别忘了留下评论和评分！这将帮助它获得更多关注并改善体验。</p>",
